{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25485","headline":"思平泉树石杂咏一十首 舴艋舟 · 李德裕","name":"思平泉树石杂咏一十首 舴艋舟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无轻舴艋舟，始自鸱夷子。\n双阙挂朝衣，五湖极烟水。\n时游杏坛下，乍入湘川里。\n永日歌濯缨，超然谢尘滓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25485.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25485","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}